<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:50:05 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>由于一名儿童拒绝坐下并系好安全带，一家航空公司不得不取消航班并重新预订第二天的乘客</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/porter-airlines-flight-cancelation-toronto-british-columbia-child/</link><description>总部位于多伦多的波特航空公司周日表示，家长和机组人员在将飞机返回航站楼之前多次尝试将孩子固定在座位上，但没有成功。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2267617113-e1786316722626.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 23:10:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/porter-airlines-flight-cancelation-toronto-british-columbia-child/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的新任白宫法律顾问领导的委员会确保了他价值 4 亿美元的宴会厅项目</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/trump-white-house-counsel-commission-400-million-ballroom-project/</link><description>威尔·沙夫将接替大卫·沃灵顿，后者将离开政府加入私营部门。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26221752276086.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 22:54:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/trump-white-house-counsel-commission-400-million-ballroom-project/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家警告说，通过支撑日元，美国和日本实际上承认美元的主导地位已不再像以前那样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/dollar-dominance-yen-usd-japan-treasury-debt-yields-intervention-dedollarization-gold/</link><description>“当这一信息深入人心时，其他国家将加倍寻找更具吸引力、更容易使用的替代品。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287651197-e1786310364916.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 22:33:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/dollar-dominance-yen-usd-japan-treasury-debt-yields-intervention-dedollarization-gold/</guid></item><item><title>更多共和党参议员呼吁米勒因虐待指控辞职</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/rep-max-miller-abuse-allegations-reelection-house-majority-gop-senators/</link><description>俄亥俄州另一位参议员乔恩·赫斯特德、蒙大拿州参议员蒂姆·希伊和堪萨斯州参议员罗杰·马歇尔也表示，代表俄亥俄州东北部的米勒应该辞职。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279933527-e1786307972952.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 20:44:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/rep-max-miller-abuse-allegations-reelection-house-majority-gop-senators/</guid></item><item><title>墨西哥湾沿岸食肉细菌感染激增，路易斯安那州报告有五人死亡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/flesh-eating-bacteria-infections-gulf-coast-deaths-louisiana/</link><description>“如果接触咸水或盐水的伤口变红、肿胀、疼痛、发热或变色，请立即就医。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26221550147955.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 20:33:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/flesh-eating-bacteria-infections-gulf-coast-deaths-louisiana/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普押注，随着更多石油从海湾流出，美国对伊朗经济的海上封锁可以实现炸弹和导弹无法实现的目标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/trump-us-naval-blockade-iran-economy-crisis-hormuz-talks-oil-prices/</link><description>特朗普表示：“我们只是看着伊朗严重的通货膨胀，而他们却没有钱。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9835119-e1786298988452.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 19:41:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/trump-us-naval-blockade-iran-economy-crisis-hormuz-talks-oil-prices/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普家族寻求增加预测市场影响力，卡尔希打击内幕交易</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/kalshi-insider-trump-truth-social-prediction-markets-polymarket/</link><description>预测市场正在与政府纠缠在一起，卡尔希正试图证明它正在监管内幕交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281484042-e1786140971868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/kalshi-insider-trump-truth-social-prediction-markets-polymarket/</guid></item><item><title>“千禧一代不再是朋克孩子”——奥卡西奥-科尔特斯认为，由于婴儿潮一代对经济前景的愤怒而引发的“代际浪潮”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/millennials-vs-boomers-alexandria-ocasio-cortez-generational-tidal-wave-anger-economic-futures/</link><description>“人们对被忽视、被边缘化、让我们的经济未来被我们的前几代人在从经济到气候等各个方面抵押的感到愤怒。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2267838482-e1786291848815.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 17:19:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/millennials-vs-boomers-alexandria-ocasio-cortez-generational-tidal-wave-anger-economic-futures/</guid></item><item><title>我建立了加拿大最大的加密货币公司。但这里的商业环境使得出售给罗宾汉不可避免</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/i-built-canadas-largest-crypto-company-but-the-business-climate-here-made-selling-to-robinhood-inevitable/</link><description>WonderFi 的首席执行官表示，他之所以出售该公司，是因为加拿大繁琐的监管环境使得国际扩张变得遥不可及。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-06-at-32713-PM.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/i-built-canadas-largest-crypto-company-but-the-business-climate-here-made-selling-to-robinhood-inevitable/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲股市的火爆引起了投资者的热议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/europe-stock-markets-stoxx-600-dax-cac-40-ftse-mib/</link><description>“该地区的恢复能力令市场感到惊讶，需求仍然比预期坚挺得多。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2232962282-e1786289242312.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 15:32:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/europe-stock-markets-stoxx-600-dax-cac-40-ftse-mib/</guid></item></channel></rss>